OL,3,GNEWSA'Running has changed my life' -
OL,4,Afundraisers on their marathon
OL,5,Amotivation
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 6,000 runners are preparing
OL,8,Fto race through the historic city of
OL,9,FYork and its surrounding villages as
OL,10,Fpart of the Yorkshire Marathon
OL,11,FFestival.
OL,13,FThe 26.2 mile (42km) course takes in
OL,14,Fsights including the 7th Century York
OL,15,FMinster and 1066 Viking battleground at
OL,16,FStamford Bridge.
OL,18,FEach has their own reasons for taking
OL,19,Fpart in Sunday's race, whether trying
OL,20,Fto set a personal best or raise money
OL,21,Ffor a cause close to their heart.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
